    <string name="lab_airplane_help_permission_body">Needs the Modify system settings permission. See \'Permission setup\' in the three-dot menu for how to grant it.</string>
    <string name="lab_airplane_help_permission_title">3. Required permission</string>
    <string name="lab_airplane_help_what_body">Turning on Airplane mode usually turns off Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and NFC too. Connections you pick here stay on when Airplane mode turns on. Mobile data is always off in Airplane mode.</string>
