    <string name="lab_clip_help_done_body">When you finish or cancel sharing, GOAT deletes the temporary files it made. Nothing is sent anywhere except the app you chose.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_done_title">Temp files deleted after sharing</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_note_body">Only the last copied item is sent. Earlier items in the keyboard\'s clipboard list can\'t be read because Android blocks access. The clipboard paste notice shown while sharing is a normal Android alert.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_note_title">Notes</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_other_body">• Long-press the GOAT icon: a \'Share Clipboard\' shortcut appears. Drag it to add it to your Home screen.\n• Share menu in other apps: choose \'Share as TXT\' to send text as a TXT file.\n• This screen: tap [%1$s] or paste into the box below.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_other_title">Other ways to share</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step1_body">Tap [%1$s] on this screen, or add the \'Share Clipboard\' tile in Quick settings edit mode. You only need to do this once.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step1_title">Add the tile</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step2_body">Copy text, photos, or files. You can send multiple images at once.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step2_title">Copy in any app</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step3_body">No need to open GOAT.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step3_title">Pull down the notification panel and tap the tile</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step4_body">Text is sent as a TXT file and photos in original quality.</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_step4_title">Choose the app and chat</string>
    <string name="lab_clip_help_what_body">• Text: TXT file (no formatting)\n• Photos (\'Copy image\' in Gallery or a browser): original image\n• Multiple images copied at once: all at once\n• Files copied in My Files: original file</string>
